  "question": {
    "text": "For some <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi></math>, let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced></math> is equal to _____ ."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2039",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p>Now, let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>So, inverse of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;i.e.,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Also,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>On comparing, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1005</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2007</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2007</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2039</mn></math></p>"
  }
}